I thought of a new "special" level that could be added. The name could be
something like "the glittering caves" . What it would consist of is a very
simple and wide ( three to five spaces across) maze, with an irregular wall
defined by the character # . Imbedded in the wall would be gems, and cruising
around throughout the maze itself would be three unicorns, one of each
alignment. Now, obviously, one would be highly motivated to dig out the gems,
so he could throw them to the unicorn to increase his luck, but therein lies
the catch. Depending on the gem, there would be nasties in a chamber behind
the gem waiting to get out. So, one could blast through the glittering caves
section and not improve his luck ( or net worth, for that matter ), or one
could "mine" some gems and fight off beasties. Simplified smaller version
( I'm too lazy to draw the whole thing! ) might look like:


